    "identifier": "lightning-release-thunder-tempest",
    "description": "<p>A wave of electrical force sweeps out from you. Each creature in a 25-foot cone originating from you must make a Strength saving throw. On a failed save a creature takes 4d4 Lightning damage are pushed back 10 feet and Shocked. On a successful save, the creature takes half as much damage.</p>\n<p>Overcharge. A creature who fails their saving throw has their initiative score reduced by 2, falling in the initiative order accordingly as a result. A creature can only have their initiative changed twice as a result of this effect.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and increase the damage by 2d4 and knock back distance 5ft.</p>",
